      "title": "Dhanuka Agritech Limited Announces Board and Board Committee Changes",
      "body": "The board of directors of Dhanuka Agritech Limited meeting held on February 5, 2026, Mr. Sachin Kumar Bhartiya (DIN: 00122147) will cease to be a Director of the Company upon completion of his second term of 5 years, at the close of business hours on February 8, 2026, with effect from 9 February, 2026. The board approved appointment of Mr. Sanjiv Goel (DIN: 03616090) as an Additional  Director designated as Non-Executive Independent Director. Mr. Sanjiv Goel has been appointed as an Additional Director (independent), till the next general meeting or for a period of three months from the date of appointment, whichever is earlier; and further as an Independent Director for a tenure of 5 consecutive years commencing from 5 February, 2026 to 4h February, 2031, subject to the approval of the Me",
